                    <div id="introduction">
                        
                        Satviky is one of the three developers of Sayori, and one of the main reason why Sayori exists. She was working on a bot named L.I.N.G.O and she needed to add few games in that. Due to heavy workload she had to drop the idea, but Kaddu volunteered to help her with the task. Later on, she motivated Kaddu to keep the game bot as his own and develop it futher. <br>
                        One of the best decision she took. Sayori soon got added to a lot of servers and was used by a lot of users.
                    </div>
